{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, move to it, take object, check properties, perform task. If object approached, take object, perform task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTaskSubtree    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
